# Project work never belongs in this repo: only each example project's starting QUESTION.md and its
# hidden task metric. Experiment runs (runs/) and condition records stay local too.
example-projects/*/*
!example-projects/*/QUESTION.md
!example-projects/*/hidden-question-metrics.md
runs/
*.nightagent.json
.venv/
__pycache__/
.env
.DS_Store
.spyproject/
